	(rectangle (start 15.24 25.4) (end 193.04 142.24) (stroke (width 0.3) (type dash) (color 90 90 90 1)) (fill (type color) (color 225 225 225 0.35)) (uuid "bed62e74-06ff-5bb7-a7d3-73766a5ec96a"))
	(text "Board-to-board header J10 (J_PWR) and charger host pull-ups" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 26.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "b30bab7c-b279-5b6e-afb1-29427aad496a"))
	(text "J10 mating side (pin map: hardware/ARCHITECTURE.md). +3V3 lives here: CE pull-up R20 100k (charge off until firmware writes VREG), INT R22 10k, charger I2C R54/R55 10k (BQ25798 table 5-1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 31.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7d5071a8-7f57-5a64-8763-99ffa6ff9f63"))
	(text "J10 pin map (hardware/ARCHITECTURE.md):\npins 1, 2: SYS, power board -> main board: system rail (cell-referred, 1.5-5.5 V), at least 1 A\npins 3, 4, 7, 8, 11, 12, 15, 16: GND (a GND row beside every signal row)\npins 5, 6: USB_VBUS, main -> power: USB-C VBUS to ACFET1 drain and VAC1\npins 9, 10: USB_DP, USB_DN, main -> power: BC1.2 detection only (BQ25798 D+/D-)\npins 13, 14: CHG_SDA, CHG_SCL: charger I2C (address 0x6B), 10k pull-ups on the main board\npin 17: CHG_INT, power -> main: open drain, 10k pull-up on the main board\npin 18: CHG_CE, main -> power: active low, 100k pull-up on the main board = charge off\nThe power board has no 3.3 V. A bought charger module that supplies SYS and GND can replace it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "766680d9-d41e-5256-9a38-582e86f54aaf"))
